        "thought_text": "Consider the optimal pairing strategy to minimize the total bribe cost. Specifically, prioritize pairing the weakest available boxer with the strongest boxer who has not yet been paired, ensuring that your friend boxer is always paired with the weakest possible opponent at each stage. This approach ensures that your friend boxer faces progressively weaker opponents throughout the tournament, minimizing the need for bribes.",
