        "revision_id": "rev_n_12_29ce7f_1",
        "node_id": "n_12_29ce7f",
        "thought_text": "Consider using a greedy approach to minimize the total bribery cost while ensuring your friend wins the tournament. For each round, pair your friend with the weakest possible opponent who hasn't been bribed yet, and bribe that opponent. This ensures that your friend advances to the next round without losing, and you incur the minimum cost necessary.",
